\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] DARPA DSO, Mathematical Challenges, BAA 07-68 (catalogue attribution: 2007), Challenge 016. Historical source mirror; unavailable in this check.
